{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6b60f39621b90c8fc1f8cafc95da46f909859bd1bfe0bcd48204e86b94e83200", "ja": "どうしたんだ、百合子。ずいぶんご機嫌じゃないか。", "zh": "怎么啦，百合子？你心情好像很好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0522244a1c1eda4ee084b40cce0a28f5214e2a60a8fdda446b81a2d27f75674", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nやっぱりわかっちゃいますか。えへへ……♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我表现得这么明显吗？嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "077c451c94cbb78c45284440b2acc7369b1f341c6fa643a38459e5fb52ec9618", "ja": "じつは、今度のお仕事が楽しみすぎて……。\n私がお人形になっちゃうなんて！", "zh": "其实，是因为我太期待这次的工作……\n竟然可以扮成人偶耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e9b65ffd86940202657ae412408e40eb3b3d0fe64ebdb71e7e0f00314f3c0cbd", "ja": "ああ、ゴシック＆ロリータ衣装のグラビアだっけ。\n百合子に合うとは思ったけど、そんなに好きなのか？", "zh": "喔，是歌德＆萝莉塔服装的写真照吧？\n我觉得很适合百合子，但没想到你这么喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "e7666d49307a94eb8d8335145c3e501be74c2001dd8853edd962ee25146de0b6", "ja": "はい！　メルヘンの世界には、\n小さい頃からずーっと憧れてましたから。", "zh": "是的！\n因为我从小就非～常憧憬童话世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "da5059744adb3ba1d78adaddac46b1c3ad438172287a26e439da2f415c04e757", "ja": "夢の世界の一部になれるみたいで、\n思わずほっぺたがゆるんじゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "感觉就好像融入梦想世界的一部分，\n我一想到就不禁嘴角上扬……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1007_p", "source_sha256": "db4368177a35ad928759419d5ffdf45edc3378e6c13c61fdca27ca1c025bd0f5", "ja": "なるほどな……でも大丈夫か？\n本番は無表情な人形を演じなきゃならないけど……。", "zh": "原来如此……可是这样没问题吗？\n正式拍摄时，你必须扮演面无表情的人偶哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "de7b228b4dbf9d3274cc4795dc36c7461a1d62207ba94241901810daffe787e5", "ja": "ああっ、言われてみれば！\nどうしよう、こんなワクワクする気持ち、隠せません！", "zh": "啊！经你这么一说！\n怎么办？我收敛不住期待万分的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "219b3b94ab2c067269117f98c947c4dfa5b8030e597244e043fa8cceefdc54e0", "ja": "うう、{$P$}さん、相談にのって\nもらえますか？　アドバイスを、ぜひアドバイスを！", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生，可以听听你的\n意见吗？我需要建议，请务必给我一点建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1010_p", "source_sha256": "748481e53733889248c7bfdc7d0834cab219be3f91cfce632e606513b34560e4", "ja": "わ、わかった。でも、メルヘンの世界か……。\nなにか資料とか、あった方がいいような……？", "zh": "我、我知道了。不过，童话世界啊……\n先找些资料应该比较好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "3be7634cf6225dd5c31347add0e9ebe0441ea5278cb132ca2f7fc25845c3d8d3", "ja": "あっ。じゃあ図書館カフェに行きましょう！\nじつは前から行きたいところがあって……えへへ♪", "zh": "啊。那就去图书馆咖啡厅吧！\n其实有家咖啡厅我一直很想去……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0102_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5e87cd0f989c180fa6fdc2ec90cd9c755c25e25de18fa9cb56a6c411a0ac8b6e", "ja": "（……どうも心から楽しみにしている様子だ。\n人形への道は遠そうだな……）", "zh": "（……她看起来打从心底感到期待。\n距离完美扮演人偶的目标似乎还很漫长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
